1
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:14,400
Hades, you're so calculating

2
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,919
and obsessed with money.

3
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:20,919
Why waste your drugs on me?

4
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,400
It's not a waste at all.

5
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:25,400
What I gave you was cheap stuff.

6
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:26,599
I don't care about that.

7
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:29,000
But I care very much about money.

8
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,719
In the Huatie Incident last time,

9
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:33,680
you cost me 500 million dollars.

10
00:02:33,719 --> 00:02:35,319
I'll make you pay it back, bit by bit.

11
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:44,439
You have quite a memory for money.

12
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,520
Aren't you afraid

13
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,319
of losing to me again?

14
00:02:55,039 --> 00:02:56,400
Sounds like you just want

15
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,039
to reunite with your wife and daughter early.

16
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:05,159
My wife and daughter are always in my heart.

17
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,840
They never left me.

18
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:15,759
You're just a coward who fears death,

19
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:20,520
hiding away, afraid to face me.

20
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:25,639
Let him go.

21
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:30,520
Let's see how you beat me today,

22
00:03:36,719 --> 00:03:37,520
Wei Tian.

23
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,120
Do you know how many drug formulas

24
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,400
I've developed by now?

25
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:45,560
What you got just now was cheap.

26
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:48,439
This is what you really need.

27
00:03:48,439 --> 00:03:49,680
It'll make you clear-headed,

28
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:52,520
craving it... addicted.

29
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,599
This is the expensive stuff.

30
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,560
Well, if it's so expensive,

31
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,599
you should keep it for yourself.

32
00:04:02,159 --> 00:04:03,360
Take it right now

33
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:07,400
and clear your head!

34
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,319
What I hate most is your arrogance.

35
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:13,520
This stuff brought me wealth,

36
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,960
brought me success.

37
00:04:15,319 --> 00:04:16,120
And you?

38
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,800
Look at yourself.

39
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,560
You have nothing.

40
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,639
Back when I was in Deep Sea,

41
00:04:28,639 --> 00:04:31,000
the drug network I painstakingly built

42
00:04:31,079 --> 00:04:33,240
was ruined all because of you!

43
00:04:34,399 --> 00:04:36,720
So many partners hated me for it!

44
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,160
Seven years!

45
00:04:39,439 --> 00:04:41,000
Seven years with my wife and son,

46
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,519
dodging assassins for seven years!

47
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:44,639
And you know what?

48
00:04:46,199 --> 00:04:47,759
They still left me in the end.

49
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:54,160
That was because of you!

50
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,720
You used Deep Sea,

51
00:04:59,959 --> 00:05:01,040
abused your authority,

52
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:05,879
to cover up your drug trafficking!

53
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:10,439
You're the one who got them killed!

54
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:12,120
Spare me your self-righteousness!

55
00:05:12,879 --> 00:05:13,680
Do you think Deep Sea

56
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,319
had only one dirty person?

57
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:18,120
Let me tell you, when profits are on the line,

58
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,839
there's no such thing as justice.

59
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:25,120
High rollers

60
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,160
are bound to lose everything.

61
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:29,879
Enough!

62
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:32,399
You have nothing now,

63
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,839
while I've risen back to the top.

64
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:36,720
Seven years of agony...

65
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:39,720
I'll make you savor every bit of it.

66
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:20,920
Back up! Step back!

67
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,720
You can't enter! You really can't!

68
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,839
Stop pushing! No entry! No entry!

69
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:25,800
Please, we beg you! -Yeah, please!

70
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,600
Stand back! Back up, back up!

71
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:29,120
Move back, quick!

72
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:30,759
Back up! Back up!

73
00:06:30,759 --> 00:06:31,839
Let us in!

74
00:06:31,959 --> 00:06:33,120
Cooperate with us, please!

75
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:35,000
All right, move back!

76
00:06:35,199 --> 00:06:37,439
These guys are straight-up extorting us!

77
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,120
Is there no law and order anymore?

78
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,720
Even the King is being hunted down.

79
00:06:41,199 --> 00:06:42,399
What law could there possibly be?

80
00:06:43,079 --> 00:06:44,120
Enough is enough!

81
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,639
What right do they have to bar our people?

82
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,199
Xiang Bei, don't be rash!

83
00:06:48,079 --> 00:06:48,879
I'm going to help!

84
00:06:49,759 --> 00:06:51,160
Let us through!

85
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:54,120
No! When I say no entry, I mean no entry!

86
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,360
Step back!

87
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,720
Make way!

88
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,639
Hurry!

89
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,240
Out of the way!

90
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,199
Move aside!

91
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,160
Everyone, don't give them money!

92
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,240
They're nothing but bandits!

93
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,160
Who are you people?

94
00:07:04,639 --> 00:07:05,879
We're with Zhong'an Group.

95
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,519
Why won't you let them into the city?

96
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,639
There's a war going on here.

97
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,040
For protecting the people in the city,

98
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:13,120
shouldn't we charge a protection fee?

99
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,639
A soldier's duty is to protect civilians!

100
00:07:15,639 --> 00:07:16,560
I'm warning you.

101
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:19,120
Don't you dare piss me off!

102
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,519
Captain.

103
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,639
I think I know that person up ahead.

104
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:26,519
I'll go check.

105
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,519
He... Helen?

106
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,519
Kam?

107
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:34,720
Kam!

108
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,160
Helen!

109
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,519
Kam, do you remember me?

110
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,240
I'd like to speak with you in private.

111
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,800
All right.

112
00:07:40,519 --> 00:07:41,600
Be careful, Helen.

113
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:48,319
Let me show you something.

114
00:07:56,519 --> 00:07:58,639
This is the King's personal watch.

115
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,959
So please believe me.

116
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,839
I didn't kidnap King José Limón.

117
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,560
On the contrary, Zhong'an has been protecting him.

118
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:08,360
And we have already...

119
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,600
safely escorted him abroad.

120
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,079
He could return at any moment...

121
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:11,839
to rally the troops...

122
00:08:11,839 --> 00:08:13,120
and strike against the terrorists.

123
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,800
Kam, I really don't want you...

124
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,399
to lose your faith...

125
00:08:17,639 --> 00:08:19,399
just because the enemy is powerful.

126
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:22,720
I've always been loyal to King José Limón.

127
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,199
Please don't forget.

128
00:08:25,399 --> 00:08:26,720
His Majesty, your King...

129
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,959
toward his Chinese friends...

130
00:08:27,959 --> 00:08:29,360
has always been very friendly.

131
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,120
Yes.

132
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:33,000
I'll let your compatriots into the city right now.

133
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:35,639
Thank you, Kam.

134
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:37,120
All right.

135
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:39,279
Open the gates! Let them through!

136
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,519
Let them enter the city!

137
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:43,559
Yes, sir!

138
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,759
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

139
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:50,039
Thank you all!

140
00:08:50,039 --> 00:08:51,720
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

141
00:09:17,919 --> 00:09:18,720
Here.

142
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,799
Thank you, sister.

143
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,399
Wh-What's wrong with her?

144
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,360
Her wound is infected.

145
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,600
She needs surgery immediately.

146
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,720
B-But...

147
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:41,679
She has a fever.

148
00:09:41,679 --> 00:09:42,600
You two grown men,

149
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,919
how did you protect her?

150
00:09:44,159 --> 00:09:45,919
It's okay, Anda. Don't blame them.

151
00:09:47,279 --> 00:09:48,000
Helen!

152
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,080
Get a doctor! Quick, hurry!

153
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:49,919
I'll get the doctor!

154
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:57,600
Doctor, how is she?

155
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,279
Her fever has broken.

156
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,919
Luckily, the wound was treated in time,

157
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:03,720
preventing a more severe infection.

158
00:10:03,799 --> 00:10:05,159
The patient needs to rest now.

159
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:06,759
I'll go check outside.

160
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,799
I'll leave her to you.

161
00:10:07,799 --> 00:10:09,559
All right. Thank you, Doctor.

162
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,600
Don't move. Don't move!

163
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:18,720
Shen Yu...

164
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:20,919
Such precious medicine...

165
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,080
Why didn't you save it

166
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,600
for someone who needs it more?

167
00:10:24,639 --> 00:10:25,600
Listen to yourself!

168
00:10:26,159 --> 00:10:27,879
The sickest person in this entire hospital

169
00:10:27,879 --> 00:10:28,639
is you!

170
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:29,840
Do you have any idea

171
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,600
you were unconscious for six whole hours?

172
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,080
We've been worried sick for six hours, too.

173
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,039
Exactly.

174
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:38,720
By the way, are our compatriots settled in?

175
00:10:39,559 --> 00:10:42,080
Don't worry, they're all checked in.

176
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,279
Though while you were out,

177
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:45,919
another wave of refugees arrived.

178
00:10:46,679 --> 00:10:48,440
The hotel is almost completely full now.

179
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:51,519
I'm fine now.

180
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:53,440
Go help them. Hurry, go!

181
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,320
I'm just glad you're okay.

182
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,600
Take good care of her. I'll go check on things.

183
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,639
Okay, go ahead.

184
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:58,080
You should go, too.

185
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:58,840
Don't move around.

186
00:10:59,879 --> 00:11:01,120
Don't worry about me. Just go!

187
00:11:02,279 --> 00:11:03,519
Are there still enough rooms?

188
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,320
Looking at how things are going,

189
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,919
it'll probably be full very soon.

190
00:11:07,159 --> 00:11:08,720
Then what about the overflow?

191
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,679
The hotel management

192
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:12,399
is meeting to discuss this today.

193
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,360
I'll talk to Anda,

194
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,159
and ask her to clear out

195
00:11:16,159 --> 00:11:16,879
all of Zhong'an's rooms

196
00:11:16,879 --> 00:11:17,720
for the refugees.

197
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,360
Sounds good.

198
00:11:23,399 --> 00:11:24,639
Anda, perfect timing.

199
00:11:24,639 --> 00:11:25,399
I was just looking for you.

200
00:11:25,399 --> 00:11:27,159
So, how is Helen doing?

201
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:27,919
She's fine now.

202
00:11:27,919 --> 00:11:29,639
She just needs to rest for a while.

203
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:32,919
Is the number of refugees still rising?

204
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,519
Yeah, more and more are coming.

205
00:11:34,519 --> 00:11:36,240
And there's no sign of it slowing down.

206
00:11:36,559 --> 00:11:37,320
So I was thinking

207
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,080
we give up the rooms

208
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:38,960
for our Zhong'an guys

209
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:39,799
to house the refugees.

210
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:42,720
Even so, that won't be enough.

211
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,159
Then let them sleep in the lobby,

212
00:11:46,159 --> 00:11:48,000
as long as we provide quilts and blankets.

213
00:11:49,159 --> 00:11:50,720
That could work.

214
00:11:50,919 --> 00:11:51,639
How about this?

215
00:11:51,639 --> 00:11:53,080
I have a video conference

216
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,000
with headquarters later.

217
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,120
I'll propose this idea.

218
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:57,559
Good. Come up with a plan as soon as possible.

219
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:58,440
Otherwise, I'm afraid

220
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,639
even the lobby will overflow.

221
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,240
Okay, I'll head out first.

222
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,120
All right, go ahead.

223
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,039
President Dan,

224
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:10,159
many refugees lately

225
00:12:10,159 --> 00:12:11,919
have started sheltering at our hotel.

226
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:14,360
The problem is, many staff members

227
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:15,879
aren't taking this seriously,

228
00:12:15,879 --> 00:12:17,960
and some even want to take advantage of them.

229
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,279
I'm afraid

230
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:21,159
this will hurt our hotel's reputation.

231
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:23,120
I've actually already heard about that.

232
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:25,159
Under these circumstances,

233
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,600
since our compatriots look to our hotel

234
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,720
as a sanctuary,

235
00:12:27,919 --> 00:12:29,519
we must never mistreat them.

236
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,720
Anda, do you have any good ideas?

237
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:33,919
Yes, I do.

238
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:35,840
I just hope that during the meeting,

239
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,919
you'll back me up.

240
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:39,759
Sure. You'll have my full support.

241
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:51,080
Regarding the recent situation in Antilocaris

242
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:53,039
and the challenges our hotel is facing,

243
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,960
I have a general grasp of it all.

244
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:56,440
That's why today,

245
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:58,120
I'd like to ask everyone here:

246
00:12:58,279 --> 00:12:59,720
Does anyone have a good solution?

247
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,960
President Dan, I think

248
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,639
we should cancel all discounts right now

249
00:13:04,679 --> 00:13:07,519
and offer all rooms at full price.

250
00:13:07,679 --> 00:13:09,320
Otherwise, we won't have enough rooms.

251
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:12,120
Yang Di, how could you say that?

252
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:14,279
Do you think they're here on vacation?

253
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:16,000
They're here seeking refuge!

254
00:13:16,039 --> 00:13:17,720
They'll still check in regardless.

255
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:19,559
No matter how expensive, they'll still stay.

256
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,360
Have you ever stopped to think

257
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,840
why in all of Antilocaris,

258
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:24,320
with so many hotels around,

259
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,840
they chose to come to Plato Hotel?

260
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:26,960
That's because we're

261
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,399
a Chinese-run hotel!

262
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:29,720
At a time like this,

263
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,399
they chose to put their trust in us.

264
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:32,759
We should do more to help them!

265
00:13:32,759 --> 00:13:33,399
If it were up to me,

266
00:13:33,399 --> 00:13:35,720
I'd say we shouldn't cancel

267
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,120
the discounts,

268
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,279
but increase them instead!

269
00:13:38,399 --> 00:13:41,080
All right, let's not get too worked up.

270
00:13:41,559 --> 00:13:44,519
Actually, Yang Di had a point just now.

271
00:13:44,519 --> 00:13:46,519
He's also looking out for the hotel's interests.

272
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,919
Anda was right too.

273
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:50,519
Our Plato Hotel is run by Chinese people.

274
00:13:50,519 --> 00:13:51,639
At the highest point of our hotel,

275
00:13:51,639 --> 00:13:53,399
flies the Five-Star Red Flag.

276
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:54,919
Therefore,

277
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:55,799
we must never,

278
00:13:55,799 --> 00:13:57,000
during extraordinary times like these,

279
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:57,840
hike up our prices

280
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,440
and exploit our own compatriots.

281
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,720
Anda, figure something out.

282
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:02,679
See if the lobby

283
00:14:02,679 --> 00:14:04,240
can accommodate more of our citizens.

284
00:14:06,879 --> 00:14:08,519
I think the lobby could work.

285
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,320
Those who didn't get a room

286
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,639
can sleep in the lobby for now.

287
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:14,240
We won't charge them anything,

288
00:14:14,559 --> 00:14:17,559
and we can hand out quilts and blankets.

289
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:21,720
I think Anda's idea is feasible.

290
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:23,960
By the way, President Dan,

291
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:26,120
with the growing number of our compatriots,

292
00:14:26,159 --> 00:14:27,759
our Western, Chinese,

293
00:14:27,759 --> 00:14:29,440
buffet restaurants, and even the café

294
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:31,080
have all been packed to capacity.

295
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:34,200
Yet some people still can't get any food.

296
00:14:34,759 --> 00:14:35,519
Our chefs

297
00:14:35,519 --> 00:14:37,200
are already working overtime,

298
00:14:37,399 --> 00:14:39,440
but given our culinary standards,

299
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:40,759
they still need more time.

300
00:14:46,279 --> 00:14:47,960
Then drop the gourmet dishes.

301
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:49,080
Make simple meals,

302
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:50,759
or even boxed lunches.

303
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:52,559
I want to make sure

304
00:14:52,759 --> 00:14:55,279
that every guest staying at our hotel

305
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,720
gets something to eat.

306
00:14:57,559 --> 00:14:59,120
Anda, even though

307
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:01,519
President Dan approved your relief plan,

308
00:15:01,759 --> 00:15:02,639
our hotel's

309
00:15:02,639 --> 00:15:03,919
financial performance still has to be met.

310
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,559
Otherwise, at the year-end

311
00:15:05,559 --> 00:15:06,720
review meeting,

312
00:15:06,799 --> 00:15:08,360
headquarters will blame us.

313
00:15:09,519 --> 00:15:11,399
Will you take the fall then?

314
00:15:13,559 --> 00:15:15,279
You're being so cold-blooded!

315
00:15:16,039 --> 00:15:17,159
So many of our compatriots

316
00:15:17,159 --> 00:15:18,960
are homeless because of the war.

317
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:21,039
Are you just going to leave them to die?

318
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,600
I didn't say we shouldn't help.

319
00:15:23,799 --> 00:15:25,200
But business is business,

320
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,080
you know?

321
00:15:35,279 --> 00:15:36,120
From headquarters:

322
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,159
Ms. Anda is hereby appointed

323
00:15:38,159 --> 00:15:40,519
as the Plato Hotel Africa Branch's

324
00:15:40,519 --> 00:15:42,919
Gen- General Manager,

325
00:15:43,559 --> 00:15:44,799
with full authority to oversee

326
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:46,639
arrangements for Chinese in Supedo.

327
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:49,320
Effective immediately for one year.

328
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:55,240
Fine.

329
00:15:56,159 --> 00:15:57,600
I won't say another word.

330
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:59,440
You're the GM. You call the shots.

331
00:16:00,879 --> 00:16:01,799
With this many people,

332
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,840
we definitely don't have enough rooms.

333
00:16:04,519 --> 00:16:05,320
You're right.

334
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,840
Looks like they'll have to make do

335
00:16:06,879 --> 00:16:08,919
and sleep on the lobby floor tonight.

336
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,039
Here's the plan, Yang Di.

337
00:16:14,559 --> 00:16:15,519
Go to the storage room

338
00:16:15,519 --> 00:16:17,279
and grab some blankets and quilts

339
00:16:17,279 --> 00:16:19,000
to pass out to those without rooms.

340
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:22,559
Got it, Gen- General Manager An.

341
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,519
I'm terribly sorry,

342
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:28,519
we only have suites left right now.

343
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:30,759
Then give me your cheapest suite.

344
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:33,519
We have a three-room suite.

345
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:35,200
After the discount, it's 200 dollars a night.

346
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,000
That's so expensive!

347
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,440
We're students traveling here.

348
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,960
We don't have that much money left.

349
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:39,559
Can't you go any lower?

350
00:16:39,559 --> 00:16:41,360
This really is our lowest discount.

351
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:42,879
After all, it has two bedrooms

352
00:16:42,879 --> 00:16:43,960
and a living room.

353
00:16:44,399 --> 00:16:45,720
But we don't need a living room,

354
00:16:45,799 --> 00:16:46,960
let alone two bedrooms.

355
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:48,639
Well...

356
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:53,279
Would you be willing to share with other guests?

357
00:16:53,279 --> 00:16:54,519
Sure! Of course we can!

358
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:57,120
From now on, for all rooms and suites,

359
00:16:57,559 --> 00:16:58,840
share them whenever guests agree.

360
00:16:59,399 --> 00:17:00,320
Yes, Manager An.

361
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:01,720
I mean, General Manager An.

362
00:17:02,159 --> 00:17:03,720
Are you completely out of rooms?

363
00:17:03,919 --> 00:17:04,920
What are we supposed to do?

364
00:17:05,759 --> 00:17:07,039
Everyone, please calm down!

365
00:17:07,119 --> 00:17:08,319
Plato Hotel

366
00:17:08,319 --> 00:17:10,440
will hand out free blankets

367
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,119
and quilts to everyone.

368
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:13,319
You can all sleep here in the lobby.

369
00:17:13,799 --> 00:17:15,920
Just make sure to register first, okay?

370
00:17:16,279 --> 00:17:17,519
Okay, I want to register!

371
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:18,839
I want to register too!

372
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:19,599
Me! Me too!

373
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:21,640
Let's sleep in the lobby too, okay?

374
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,319
Sure.

375
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:24,119
The room I just booked,

376
00:17:24,119 --> 00:17:25,319
can I still cancel it?

377
00:17:26,599 --> 00:17:27,400
Let them cancel.

378
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:28,519
And...

379
00:17:29,079 --> 00:17:31,200
if anyone else wants to cancel their room

380
00:17:31,279 --> 00:17:32,920
to sleep in the lobby, refund them too.

381
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:34,759
Alright, I'll process your refund right away.

382
00:17:44,799 --> 00:17:46,599
There are more and more refugees in the lobby.

383
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,000
At this rate,

384
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:50,359
the hotel rooms will run out soon.

385
00:17:50,599 --> 00:17:51,319
I heard Anda

386
00:17:51,319 --> 00:17:52,839
went to get blankets and quilts.

387
00:17:52,839 --> 00:17:53,960
She'll arrange for the refugees

388
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:55,160
to make beds on the floor here.

389
00:17:55,839 --> 00:17:56,920
That's a good idea.

390
00:17:58,079 --> 00:17:58,880
Anda.

391
00:17:59,599 --> 00:18:00,440
What are you doing here?

392
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,680
Why aren't you resting?

393
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,319
How's your injury?

394
00:18:02,319 --> 00:18:03,200
Much better, much better.

395
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:04,440
See? I'm fine.

396
00:18:06,119 --> 00:18:06,920
Anda,

397
00:18:07,799 --> 00:18:10,440
I heard you're now General Manager An.

398
00:18:12,359 --> 00:18:13,519
Who told her?

399
00:18:13,759 --> 00:18:15,920
I didn't say a thing, General Manager An.

400
00:18:18,039 --> 00:18:19,079
It's a good thing.

401
00:18:19,079 --> 00:18:19,680
That way,

402
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:21,000
you can use your authority

403
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,519
to help our compatriots.

404
00:18:23,079 --> 00:18:24,160
I realized that too.

405
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:26,000
Since they made me General Manager An,

406
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:27,680
I have to do a good job, right?

407
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:30,400
That way, I can convince the rest of management.

408
00:18:30,839 --> 00:18:31,599
Take Yang Di—

409
00:18:31,599 --> 00:18:32,680
I just asked him to get

410
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:34,079
some quilts and blankets,

411
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:36,319
and he looked completely displeased.

412
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:37,519
And then Xiao Chuan,

413
00:18:37,839 --> 00:18:39,119
he's doing much better now.

414
00:18:39,119 --> 00:18:41,000
He feels more and more for our compatriots,

415
00:18:41,079 --> 00:18:42,480
and he even lets the kids

416
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:43,640
play with his prized toys.

417
00:18:45,599 --> 00:18:46,480
You're all here.

418
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,359
Thanks for your hard work.

419
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:48,240
It's my duty.

420
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:50,720
Listen, I just got word.

421
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:51,759
The consulate has started preparing

422
00:18:51,759 --> 00:18:52,640
for the citizen evacuation.

423
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:54,359
Chartered flights will arrive soon to pick them up.

424
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,079
That's great!

425
00:18:55,079 --> 00:18:56,440
When will the planes get here?

426
00:18:56,519 --> 00:18:57,599
Within two days or so.

427
00:18:58,359 --> 00:19:00,039
Our hotel can't hold out that long.

428
00:19:00,759 --> 00:19:02,200
There's another problem.

429
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,640
I just heard from a refugee

430
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:04,680
that a group of terrorists

431
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:06,559
plans to use refugee hostages as leverage.

432
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:08,559
They'll likely make their move tonight.

433
00:19:08,559 --> 00:19:09,519
All the refugees in the hotels

434
00:19:09,519 --> 00:19:10,960
could become their targets.

435
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:13,319
Isn't that extremely dangerous?

436
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,519
Looks like we need to step up security.

437
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:17,799
By the way, Xiang Bei,

438
00:19:18,599 --> 00:19:19,400
how many of our Zhong'an personnel

439
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:20,599
are still left at the hotel?

440
00:19:20,599 --> 00:19:21,640
Counting the few of us,

441
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,920
around a dozen people.

442
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,319
Actually, Zhong'an's Africa branch

443
00:19:25,319 --> 00:19:26,480
still has around a hundred people,

444
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:27,359
but they're all assigned elsewhere

445
00:19:27,359 --> 00:19:28,440
on security details.

446
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,640
Right now, the only available manpower

447
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:31,000
is what we have here at the hotel.

448
00:19:33,079 --> 00:19:35,240
Shen Yu, go get the Captain.

449
00:19:35,359 --> 00:19:36,519
We need to work out a strategy together.

450
00:19:36,559 --> 00:19:38,000
Okay. You look after Helen.

451
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:38,640
Will do.

452
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:45,599
If the enemy wants to take hostages

453
00:19:45,599 --> 00:19:46,759
among the hotel guests tonight,

454
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:47,960
the most likely scenario

455
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,839
is a frontal breach into the lobby.

456
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:52,039
After all, that would maximize the shock factor.

457
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:54,599
The chances of them breaching other entrances

458
00:19:54,599 --> 00:19:55,440
aren't very high.

459
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:57,000
Because they probably don't know

460
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,119
the hotel's interior layout well.

461
00:19:59,279 --> 00:20:00,519
Still, just to be safe...

462
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:03,119
Helen, you're injured this time,

463
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:04,200
so handle dispatch for now.

464
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:08,319
Anda, you'll be in charge of

465
00:20:08,359 --> 00:20:10,319
securing all the hotel's doors and windows.

466
00:20:10,519 --> 00:20:11,799
Then dim the interior lights

467
00:20:11,799 --> 00:20:12,680
to the bare minimum.

468
00:20:12,839 --> 00:20:13,759
Make sure

469
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:16,720
the hotel doesn't draw too much attention in the dark.

470
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,400
If any guests ask,

471
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,759
keep them calm first.

472
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:22,039
Then why don't we just

473
00:20:22,039 --> 00:20:23,319
turn off all the lights?

474
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:25,119
Because if we do that,

475
00:20:25,119 --> 00:20:26,599
it'll definitely cause guests to panic.

476
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:27,960
And if chaos breaks out,

477
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:29,200
it'll be even harder to control.

478
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,200
Besides, doing that

479
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:32,119
would make coordination difficult

480
00:20:32,119 --> 00:20:33,200
for our security team.

481
00:20:34,839 --> 00:20:35,640
By the way, Anda,

482
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:38,119
does the hotel have any secret passageways?

483
00:20:39,599 --> 00:20:40,400
No.

484
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:45,759
In short, our top priority tonight

485
00:20:45,759 --> 00:20:47,319
is defending the main entrance.

486
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:49,880
Shen Yu, gather all our Zhong'an brothers.

487
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:51,759
We must hold the main entrance tonight.

488
00:20:51,799 --> 00:20:53,400
The Captain and I will be there as well.

489
00:20:53,519 --> 00:20:54,319
Understood.

490
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,160
Tonight's mission is tricky,

491
00:20:57,240 --> 00:20:58,160
because we have no idea

492
00:20:58,160 --> 00:20:59,319
how many enemies are coming.

493
00:20:59,480 --> 00:21:00,519
We must make full use of

494
00:21:00,519 --> 00:21:01,680
every bit of manpower we have.

495
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:04,559
Uncle Qu, do you think

496
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:06,039
there's anything else to add?

497
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:10,759
The security plan looks fine.

498
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,960
I'm just worried about one thing:

499
00:21:13,599 --> 00:21:15,920
our firepower is too weak.

500
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:18,519
We're dealing with terrorists, after all.

501
00:21:20,079 --> 00:21:22,079
In that case, we must find ways

502
00:21:22,119 --> 00:21:23,680
to use everything at our disposal.

503
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:26,559
At this point, we'll just have to gamble.

504
00:21:26,599 --> 00:21:27,400
Gamble on what?

505
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:28,920
Gamble that they won't dare force their way in.

506
00:21:30,599 --> 00:21:32,599
Anda, go have the hotel dim the lights,

507
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,920
and make sure to keep the guests calm.

508
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:38,079
Helen, grab the night vision binoculars

509
00:21:38,079 --> 00:21:39,000
and scout from a vantage point.

510
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,359
Keep us updated if anything happens.

511
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:41,920
The rest of you, follow me.

512
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:43,240
Move out.

513
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:57,640
Turn off 105, 106, and 110.

514
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:05,720
202, 203, 204.

515
00:22:09,039 --> 00:22:10,599
What's going on? What happened?

516
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:12,440
What's happening? Are we in danger?

517
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:13,119
Why did the power go out?

518
00:22:13,119 --> 00:22:13,920
There's no power.

519
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:14,759
I don't know.

520
00:22:14,759 --> 00:22:16,279
Maybe Anda—no,

521
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:18,000
General Manager An turned it off, I guess.

522
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:19,440
What happened?

523
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:20,359
All right, it's okay.

524
00:22:20,359 --> 00:22:21,279
Keep getting your blankets.

525
00:22:21,279 --> 00:22:22,039
It's fine, it's fine.

526
00:22:22,039 --> 00:22:22,960
I'll go take a look.

527
00:22:24,079 --> 00:22:25,279
What's going on?

528
00:22:25,359 --> 00:22:27,279
Why shut off so many lights all of a sudden?

529
00:22:28,279 --> 00:22:29,160
Well, you see,

530
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:32,279
the city's power grid is running low,

531
00:22:32,279 --> 00:22:34,640
so we're doing our best to cooperate.

532
00:22:35,319 --> 00:22:36,559
Oh, so that's why.

533
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:39,359
Can't help that, then. All right.

534
00:22:43,279 --> 00:22:45,640
Anda, what's the situation?

535
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:47,519
Since when did we have voltage issues here?

536
00:22:48,799 --> 00:22:51,480
Zhong'an Group sent over some new intel.

537
00:22:51,559 --> 00:22:53,680
They said terrorists have entered the city.

538
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:54,720
Our place...

539
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:56,720
might be targeted for an attack.

540
00:22:59,240 --> 00:23:00,319
Smart thinking.

541
00:23:00,319 --> 00:23:01,359
This is the right call.

542
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:02,880
If we turn the lights off,

543
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:04,680
we won't draw their attention easily.

544
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:09,440
Leaving some on will prevent guest panic,

545
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:11,640
but we should shut off as many as possible.

546
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:15,960
Xiaoxue, help Anda set everything up.

547
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:16,279
Okay.

548
00:23:16,279 --> 00:23:17,839
I'll go explain things to the guests.

549
00:23:45,400 --> 00:23:47,079
Xiang Bei, Captain, they're here.

550
00:23:47,279 --> 00:23:48,640
Around 10 to 20 of them.

551
00:23:54,799 --> 00:23:56,119
They've stopped outside, scoping it out.

552
00:23:59,039 --> 00:24:00,039
Copy that.

553
00:24:00,480 --> 00:24:01,720
Keep scouting from up there.

554
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:03,519
Drop a couple of flashbangs if necessary.

555
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:04,480
Understood.

556
00:24:06,519 --> 00:24:08,440
They're here. Stick to the plan.

557
00:24:09,039 --> 00:24:12,359
Don't panic, everyone. Stay calm.

558
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:23,720
Xiao Bei, will this work?

559
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:26,039
I think it's worth a shot.

560
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:33,920
Captain, do you think this bluff will work?

561
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:36,240
We'll see.

562
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:48,279
Why are there armed guards here?

563
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:50,240
Maybe we should pick another target.

564
00:24:54,319 --> 00:24:55,839
Let's check out the next location.

565
00:25:10,079 --> 00:25:11,480
Xiang Bei, Captain, they're gone.

566
00:25:12,039 --> 00:25:13,599
Looks like they're off to find

567
00:25:13,599 --> 00:25:14,839
their next target.

568
00:25:14,880 --> 00:25:15,880
Copy that.

569
00:25:18,119 --> 00:25:18,920
They're gone.

570
00:25:22,799 --> 00:25:24,720
Turns out that trick actually worked.

571
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:27,880
Liu, Zhang, Li, Wang...

572
00:25:27,880 --> 00:25:29,839
You four take the night watch tonight.

573
00:25:29,839 --> 00:25:31,480
Report anything unusual to me immediately.

574
00:25:31,599 --> 00:25:32,519
The rest of you, follow me.

575
00:25:32,559 --> 00:25:33,680
Everyone else, let's move.

576
00:25:33,680 --> 00:25:34,319
Move.

577
00:25:59,559 --> 00:26:01,920
Everyone seems pretty restless.

578
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:03,279
Yeah.

579
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:06,160
There are way too many people in the lobby.

580
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:07,119
It's really crowded.

581
00:26:07,839 --> 00:26:09,279
Seems like we need to do something.

582
00:26:09,599 --> 00:26:11,240
Otherwise, with everyone so agitated,

583
00:26:11,519 --> 00:26:13,079
who knows what might happen.

584
00:26:14,839 --> 00:26:15,880
I have an idea.

585
00:26:16,319 --> 00:26:18,759
How about we put on a concert?

586
00:26:19,359 --> 00:26:21,559
Back at the Plato Hotel,

587
00:26:21,559 --> 00:26:23,480
we used to hold a concert every night.

588
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:25,440
The atmosphere was great.

589
00:26:25,759 --> 00:26:28,319
With the situation outside right now,

590
00:26:28,319 --> 00:26:29,640
where are you going to find a band?

591
00:26:30,319 --> 00:26:31,960
Well, we have instruments!

592
00:26:31,960 --> 00:26:33,440
We can put one together ourselves.

593
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:36,119
Do any of you play an instrument?

594
00:26:36,119 --> 00:26:37,160
I can play the piano.

595
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:38,920
And you?

596
00:26:40,319 --> 00:26:43,079
Well, I actually think

597
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:44,839
we should give it a try.

598
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:47,319
I think we can try it, too.

599
00:26:48,839 --> 00:26:50,519
I also think

600
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:51,880
it's worth a shot.

601
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:54,519
As for instruments,

602
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:55,839
I can play the violin.

603
00:26:59,799 --> 00:27:02,440
You're tone-deaf and you play the violin?

604
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:03,720
Come on,

605
00:27:04,240 --> 00:27:06,559
does playing the violin

606
00:27:06,559 --> 00:27:07,680
have anything to do with being tone-deaf?

607
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:10,119
Besides, my dad forced me to learn it.

608
00:27:10,319 --> 00:27:11,839
At least I can play a little now,

609
00:27:11,839 --> 00:27:13,839
just not as well as Sister Rosie.

610
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:16,480
Where are the instruments now?

611
00:27:17,079 --> 00:27:19,160
In the storage room.

612
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,200
We can go get them ourselves.

613
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:20,880
Okay.

614
00:27:26,279 --> 00:27:28,240
To all our friends staying at the Plato Hotel,

615
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:29,079
hello, everyone.

616
00:27:29,759 --> 00:27:31,119
Thank you all so much for bearing with us.

617
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:34,039
I'm Anda, GM of the Plato Hotel.

618
00:27:34,039 --> 00:27:35,640
I have good news for everyone.

619
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:37,599
The Chinese government

620
00:27:37,599 --> 00:27:39,759
has sent evacuation planes

621
00:27:39,759 --> 00:27:41,880
to Antilocaris to pick you up.

622
00:27:41,960 --> 00:27:43,079
I believe that everyone

623
00:27:43,200 --> 00:27:45,119
will be safely back home very soon.

624
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:47,240
However, what everyone needs to do right now

625
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:48,480
is wait patiently.

626
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:52,200
Great! Wonderful!

627
00:27:52,359 --> 00:27:54,319
To thank you all

628
00:27:54,319 --> 00:27:55,160
for supporting us through this time,

629
00:27:55,160 --> 00:27:56,680
we've put together a band.

630
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:58,599
However, we're still in need of

631
00:27:58,599 --> 00:28:00,039
a cellist.

632
00:28:00,039 --> 00:28:02,160
Is there anyone who can step forward

633
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:02,960
and help us out?

634
00:28:03,799 --> 00:28:05,759
I used to play cello in an orchestra.

635
00:28:06,759 --> 00:28:08,519
Let's give him a round of applause!

636
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:13,519
Please, come up!

637
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:21,960
What piece are we playing?

638
00:28:22,640 --> 00:28:24,319
Let's play the one from

639
00:28:24,319 --> 00:28:25,759
the Casablanca Concert Hall,

640
00:28:25,839 --> 00:28:26,720
"As Time Goes By."

641
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:28,240
"As Time Goes By."

642
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:57,480
Darling,

643
00:28:57,480 --> 00:28:59,200
before leaving Antilocaris,

644
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,240
let's have a dance.

645
00:29:00,240 --> 00:29:01,000
All right.

646
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:02,480
Let's go.

647
00:30:44,119 --> 00:30:48,119
Anda, don't be afraid. I'm with you.

648
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:01,480
Shalan,

649
00:31:03,799 --> 00:31:04,799
what are you doing?

650
00:31:04,799 --> 00:31:05,960
Moving in for good?

651
00:31:06,559 --> 00:31:08,839
Rossi, this is your graduation test.

652
00:31:08,839 --> 00:31:09,640
Question one:

653
00:31:10,319 --> 00:31:11,680
keep yourself safe.

654
00:31:12,559 --> 00:31:13,440
Don't worry.

655
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:14,279
We'll also protect

656
00:31:14,279 --> 00:31:15,559
Zuo Feichen and Anda.

657
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:17,880
Anda, stay here.

658
00:31:17,880 --> 00:31:19,519
You must keep yourself safe first.

659
00:31:19,519 --> 00:31:21,519
Don't go out without orders.

660
00:31:21,519 --> 00:31:22,880
We can't take any more risks.

661
00:31:22,960 --> 00:31:24,079
All units, report your positions.

662
00:31:24,799 --> 00:31:27,519
Location: computer room. Secure.

663
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:28,920
Anda is safe.

664
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:39,880
Stop right there!

665
00:31:50,119 --> 00:31:51,160
We at Zhong'an Group

666
00:31:51,319 --> 00:31:53,640
are China's top overseas security firm.

667
00:31:54,359 --> 00:31:55,960
In the air, on the ground, or at sea,

668
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:57,039
whenever you're in danger,

669
00:31:57,160 --> 00:31:58,839
we'll drop in to the rescue.

670
00:32:00,160 --> 00:32:01,640
Just like a responsible man

671
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:02,839
ought to do.

672
00:32:03,599 --> 00:32:05,440
If you're willing to be the boss lady here,

673
00:32:05,480 --> 00:32:06,720
I'll buy this place.

674
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:07,880
You run the inside, and I'll handle the outside.

675
00:32:17,200 --> 00:32:19,920
The world may seem peaceful,

676
00:32:20,839 --> 00:32:23,680
but it hides so many dangers.

677
00:32:25,079 --> 00:32:26,640
The eagle is the master of the sky.

678
00:32:27,759 --> 00:32:28,960
I'm not that overbearing.

679
00:32:29,319 --> 00:32:31,119
Yet whenever I see you save lives,

680
00:32:31,240 --> 00:32:32,480
you never seem afraid.

681
00:32:32,799 --> 00:32:35,319
What I fear most is saving people.

682
00:32:39,119 --> 00:32:39,920
It's a tie.

683
00:32:40,880 --> 00:32:41,640
It's a tie.

684
00:32:43,559 --> 00:32:44,440
Sometimes,

685
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:47,079
people aren't afraid of not remembering.

686
00:32:47,880 --> 00:32:49,480
What's truly terrifying is when you want to forget,

687
00:32:49,799 --> 00:32:50,599
and you can't.

688
00:34:41,039 --> 00:34:42,119
It hurts, it hurts.

689
00:34:42,119 --> 00:34:43,519
Bear with it. Just hang in there.

690
00:34:44,880 --> 00:34:45,719
Almost done.

691
00:34:46,519 --> 00:34:47,639
Here, have some water.

692
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:54,320
It's okay.

693
00:34:57,000 --> 00:34:59,039
Look, everyone! They're raising the national flag outside!

694
00:34:59,320 --> 00:35:01,480
Look, everyone! The national flag is being raised outside!

695
00:35:01,639 --> 00:35:02,760
Come on, let's go! They're raising the flag!

696
00:35:02,760 --> 00:35:03,360
Look!

697
00:35:03,360 --> 00:35:03,719
Let's go, let's go!

698
00:35:03,719 --> 00:35:04,840
They're raising the national flag over there!

699
00:35:04,840 --> 00:35:05,440
Hurry up!

700
00:35:05,440 --> 00:35:06,039
Look, look!

701
00:35:06,039 --> 00:35:07,440
They're raising the flag! Look!

702
00:35:07,480 --> 00:35:08,320
The flag is going up over there!

703
00:35:08,320 --> 00:35:10,360
Mommy, look! The Five-Star Red Flag!

704
00:35:10,639 --> 00:35:12,360
Yes, sweetie. Can you sing the national anthem?

705
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:13,280
Yes, I can!

706
00:35:13,440 --> 00:35:15,320
Let's sing along with everyone, okay?

707
00:35:15,320 --> 00:35:15,960
Okay!

708
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:21,639
Arise, ye who refuse to be slaves!

709
00:35:22,159 --> 00:35:24,440
With our flesh and blood,

710
00:35:24,639 --> 00:35:28,280
Let us build our new Great Wall!

711
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:32,119
The Chinese nation faces

712
00:35:32,119 --> 00:35:34,920
Its greatest peril.

713
00:35:35,239 --> 00:35:40,039
From each one the urgent call for action comes forth.

714
00:35:40,039 --> 00:35:44,480
Arise! Arise! Arise!

715
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:46,960
Millions with but one heart,

716
00:35:47,119 --> 00:35:50,920
Braving the enemy's fire, march on!

717
00:35:51,039 --> 00:35:56,119
Braving the enemy's fire, march on! March on!

718
00:35:56,559 --> 00:35:58,280
Look! They're raising our national flag!

719
00:35:58,599 --> 00:36:02,639
Arise, ye who refuse to be slaves!

720
00:36:03,119 --> 00:36:05,280
With our flesh and blood,

721
00:36:05,400 --> 00:36:08,880
Let us build our new Great Wall!

722
00:36:09,199 --> 00:36:12,360
The Chinese nation faces

723
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:15,440
Its greatest peril.

724
00:36:15,760 --> 00:36:19,880
From each one the urgent call for action comes forth.

725
00:36:20,480 --> 00:36:24,800
Arise! Arise! Arise!

726
00:36:24,800 --> 00:36:27,079
Millions with but one heart,

727
00:36:27,360 --> 00:36:31,159
Braving the enemy's fire, march on!

728
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:33,840
Braving the enemy's fire,

729
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:39,039
March on! March on! March on, on!

730
00:36:44,719 --> 00:36:45,599
It's been so long since I've visited

731
00:36:45,599 --> 00:36:47,360
the coast of Antilocaris.

732
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:48,800
Yeah.

733
00:36:49,119 --> 00:36:51,079
One thing after another ever since we got back.

734
00:36:51,440 --> 00:36:52,760
Haven't even had time to find a place

735
00:36:52,760 --> 00:36:53,559
to get some peace and quiet.

736
00:36:55,159 --> 00:36:57,480
Xiang Bei, you know what?

737
00:36:57,880 --> 00:37:01,079
Your brother used to love coming here.

738
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:05,119
Back when my brother and I went on missions,

739
00:37:05,880 --> 00:37:08,039
only when we reached international waters

740
00:37:08,079 --> 00:37:09,360
were we allowed to carry weapons.

741
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:11,880
As a soldier,

742
00:37:12,599 --> 00:37:14,440
it was only natural for him to love the sea.

743
00:37:18,639 --> 00:37:19,760
Do you miss him?

744
00:37:20,119 --> 00:37:21,239
I miss him so much.

745
00:37:25,519 --> 00:37:26,559
Before my brother died in action,

746
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:28,480
the last thing he said to me was

747
00:37:28,840 --> 00:37:30,440
that Zhong'an's future depends on me.

748
00:37:33,239 --> 00:37:34,559
I won't let him down.

749
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:38,440
He can definitely see that.

750
00:37:38,880 --> 00:37:40,639
Besides, things are in such chaos right now.

751
00:37:41,400 --> 00:37:43,039
It's been really tough on you and Zhong'an.

752
00:37:43,639 --> 00:37:44,440
Don't say that.

753
00:37:46,880 --> 00:37:48,199
Although in times of war,

754
00:37:48,199 --> 00:37:49,639
what one person can do is very limited,

755
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:52,679
as long as everyone pulls together

756
00:37:52,800 --> 00:37:54,119
like at the concert earlier,

757
00:37:54,519 --> 00:37:56,239
there's no hurdle we can't overcome.

758
00:37:59,119 --> 00:38:00,159
Last night,

759
00:38:00,159 --> 00:38:02,119
where did that bunch of terrorists go?

760
00:38:02,119 --> 00:38:02,679
I heard

761
00:38:02,679 --> 00:38:04,719
they went to an estate out in the suburbs,

762
00:38:04,760 --> 00:38:06,000
and in that estate,

763
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:07,360
it's packed with Chinese compatriots.

764
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:09,360
Those terrorists

765
00:38:09,360 --> 00:38:10,639
took our compatriots hostage,

766
00:38:10,639 --> 00:38:12,880
as leverage to demand a troop withdrawal.

767
00:38:13,199 --> 00:38:14,360
But the fighting between both sides

768
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:15,639
has reached a fever pitch.

769
00:38:15,679 --> 00:38:16,960
A withdrawal is out of the question.

770
00:38:17,599 --> 00:38:19,920
In the end, the government sent a small police force

771
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:21,079
to rescue our people,

772
00:38:21,679 --> 00:38:23,079
but with little success.

773
00:38:23,400 --> 00:38:24,920
So what does the consulate plan to do now?

774
00:38:24,920 --> 00:38:27,440
Consul Wu is facing huge pressure from back home.

775
00:38:27,679 --> 00:38:29,440
Following the riots, the Supedo government

776
00:38:29,480 --> 00:38:31,079
has not been recognized by the international community

777
00:38:31,079 --> 00:38:32,119
or by our country.

778
00:38:32,360 --> 00:38:33,119
On top of that,

779
00:38:33,119 --> 00:38:35,079
there are no regular channels of communication yet.

780
00:38:35,559 --> 00:38:36,360
Still, Consul Wu

781
00:38:36,360 --> 00:38:37,079
is actively

782
00:38:37,079 --> 00:38:38,760
negotiating with the local police,

783
00:38:39,079 --> 00:38:40,280
and he asked Zhong'an

784
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:41,800
to do everything we can

785
00:38:41,800 --> 00:38:42,880
to coordinate with them.

786
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:44,760
Leave it to us.

787
00:38:45,119 --> 00:38:46,960
With our people in danger, Zhong'an won't stand by.

788
00:38:47,079 --> 00:38:47,880
Let's go.

789
00:38:48,199 --> 00:38:49,000
Wait a second.

790
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:50,639
You're still injured.

791
00:38:50,639 --> 00:38:52,159
The doctor told you to get some rest.

792
00:38:52,320 --> 00:38:53,480
These are just minor injuries.

793
00:38:55,079 --> 00:38:55,880
President An!

794
00:38:56,719 --> 00:38:58,119
More wounded have arrived at the hotel.

795
00:38:58,119 --> 00:38:59,400
I can't handle it on my own.

796
00:38:59,400 --> 00:39:00,599
I asked Yang Di to help,

797
00:39:00,599 --> 00:39:02,079
but he completely ignored me!

798
00:39:02,400 --> 00:39:03,440
That Yang Di...

799
00:39:03,480 --> 00:39:05,239
In... in that case, I'll go help first.

800
00:39:05,239 --> 00:39:06,519
All right, let's head out too.

801
00:39:07,000 --> 00:39:08,679
Shen Yu, stay here and tend to the wounded.

802
00:39:09,519 --> 00:39:11,320
Helen, you shouldn't go.

803
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:12,159
You're still injured.

804
00:39:12,159 --> 00:39:13,639
Just stay here and rest up.

805
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:15,519
I'll go with Xiao Bei.

806
00:39:15,800 --> 00:39:16,679
Stay safe.

807
00:39:17,199 --> 00:39:18,719
Let us know right away if you need backup.

808
00:39:18,719 --> 00:39:19,360
All right.

809
00:39:24,800 --> 00:39:25,880
Helen, Mr. Shen.

810
00:39:25,880 --> 00:39:26,679
Right now,

811
00:39:26,679 --> 00:39:28,239
we're facing a shortage of medicine.

812
00:39:28,239 --> 00:39:29,559
Many refugees are injured

813
00:39:29,559 --> 00:39:30,880
and desperately need antibiotics.

814
00:39:31,039 --> 00:39:32,199
Several diabetic patients,

815
00:39:32,199 --> 00:39:33,360
having run out of insulin,

816
00:39:33,360 --> 00:39:35,039
haven't eaten anything all day.

817
00:39:35,519 --> 00:39:36,360
How much of the tetanus

818
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:37,840
antitoxin is left?

819
00:39:38,360 --> 00:39:39,199
We're completely out.

820
00:39:39,199 --> 00:39:40,519
The last dose was used on you.

821
00:39:40,559 --> 00:39:41,760
Who told you to use it on me?

822
00:39:41,760 --> 00:39:43,519
Why didn't you save it for someone who needed it more?

823
00:39:44,159 --> 00:39:45,440
Given your condition at the time,

824
00:39:45,440 --> 00:39:46,280
if we hadn't used it,

825
00:39:46,280 --> 00:39:47,679
you might never have woken up.

826
00:39:47,679 --> 00:39:49,519
Is there any other way right now

827
00:39:49,519 --> 00:39:50,519
to get more medical supplies?

828
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:54,079
We'll figure something out.

829
00:39:54,239 --> 00:39:55,119
Go attend to your work for now.

830
00:39:55,119 --> 00:39:55,760
Okay.

831
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:03,639
Shen Yu.

832
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:05,239
I just remembered...

833
00:40:05,239 --> 00:40:07,440
...something Consul Wu told me earlier.

834
00:40:08,039 --> 00:40:09,559
It might solve our problem.

835
00:40:09,960 --> 00:40:10,760
What is it?

836
00:40:11,639 --> 00:40:13,119
After the terrorist attack,

837
00:40:13,159 --> 00:40:14,360
to help with the citizen evacuation,

838
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:16,159
our country dispatched

839
00:40:16,159 --> 00:40:17,760
a cargo ship operating nearby.

840
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:19,440
It was heading to the Port of Antilocaris

841
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,679
carrying a batch of supplies.

842
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:23,360
There are daily essentials, medicines,

843
00:40:23,639 --> 00:40:25,280
and plasma of various blood types,

844
00:40:25,320 --> 00:40:26,760
even rare ones.

845
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:28,760
The catch is that these supplies

846
00:40:28,760 --> 00:40:30,719
are stuck in a military port warehouse.

847
00:40:30,840 --> 00:40:31,719
That's wonderful!

848
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:33,679
That'll solve the medicine problem.

849
00:40:34,719 --> 00:40:36,039
But will the military

850
00:40:36,039 --> 00:40:37,440
hand those supplies over to us?

851
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:39,880
Consul Wu already got

852
00:40:39,880 --> 00:40:41,239
a release permit from them.

853
00:40:41,800 --> 00:40:43,280
There's just one problem now.

854
00:40:43,679 --> 00:40:44,440
What problem?

855
00:40:44,599 --> 00:40:47,159
The route from here to the port is a war zone.

856
00:40:47,480 --> 00:40:48,280
It's too dangerous.

857
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:50,440
No matter how dangerous, someone must go.

858
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:51,880
I'll go retrieve the supplies.

859
00:40:52,199 --> 00:40:53,559
You stay here and care for the wounded.

860
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:55,199
Okay.

861
00:40:55,400 --> 00:40:57,280
Then I'll call Consul Wu right now

862
00:40:57,599 --> 00:40:59,320
and have him contact the port military.

863
00:40:59,559 --> 00:41:00,679
That way, once you arrive,

864
00:41:00,679 --> 00:41:01,519
he can send vehicles

865
00:41:01,519 --> 00:41:02,960
to help bring the supplies back.

866
00:41:03,840 --> 00:41:05,440
After the riots broke out,

867
00:41:05,760 --> 00:41:07,440
didn't our Chinese personnel evacuate?

868
00:41:07,880 --> 00:41:10,360
I heard most of them have,

869
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:11,800
but a small team stayed behind.

870
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:13,159
They helped build the port—

871
00:41:13,159 --> 00:41:14,039
Chinese personnel.

872
00:41:14,039 --> 00:41:14,760
Together with the locals,

873
00:41:14,760 --> 00:41:16,239
they've been keeping the port running.

874
00:41:16,480 --> 00:41:18,320
Only then, once peace is restored,

875
00:41:18,519 --> 00:41:19,960
can our country's port interests

876
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:21,119
be properly secured.

877
00:41:21,199 --> 00:41:23,280
That's great. I'm leaving right away.

878
00:41:24,360 --> 00:41:26,400
Helen, a pregnant woman is having complications.

879
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:27,840
Please come over and help calm her down.

880
00:41:27,840 --> 00:41:28,480
Okay.

881
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:30,000
Thanks. I'll head over first.

882
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:30,679
All right.

883
00:41:31,119 --> 00:41:31,639
Hurry!

884
00:41:31,639 --> 00:41:32,320
Make way!

885
00:41:32,320 --> 00:41:33,000
Move aside, quickly!

886
00:41:33,000 --> 00:41:33,679
Quick!

887
00:41:36,119 --> 00:41:37,280
Almost there. Hang in there.

888
00:41:37,280 --> 00:41:38,880
Anda, she's in labor!

889
00:41:38,880 --> 00:41:40,039
Are there any rooms available?

890
00:41:40,320 --> 00:41:41,599
How about your old room?

891
00:41:41,599 --> 00:41:43,039
Okay. Take deep breaths.

892
00:41:43,079 --> 00:41:44,719
Did Xiang Bei and the others go to the manor?

893
00:41:45,000 --> 00:41:46,360
Xiang Bei and the Captain went.

894
00:41:46,360 --> 00:41:48,440
Shen Yu is on a solo special mission.

895
00:41:48,639 --> 00:41:49,679
Where did Shen Yu go?

896
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:50,920
I'll tell you later.

897
00:41:52,360 --> 00:41:54,239
Deep breaths. We're here.

898
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:09,280
How is the patient?

899
00:42:10,519 --> 00:42:11,559
Don't worry, everyone.

900
00:42:11,639 --> 00:42:12,800
The mother is stable,

901
00:42:12,800 --> 00:42:13,960
and the doctor is delivering the baby.

902
00:42:13,960 --> 00:42:14,760
That's good.

903
00:42:15,559 --> 00:42:17,559
Where did Shen Yu go?

904
00:42:18,079 --> 00:42:19,039
As you can see,

905
00:42:19,079 --> 00:42:20,360
the lobby is completely packed,

906
00:42:20,360 --> 00:42:22,360
and we're in dire need of supplies and medicine.

907
00:42:22,920 --> 00:42:24,679
Shen Yu has to cross the war zone

908
00:42:24,679 --> 00:42:25,760
to pick up a shipment at the port—

909
00:42:25,760 --> 00:42:27,280
supplies sent from back home.

910
00:42:27,639 --> 00:42:28,360
Among them

911
00:42:28,360 --> 00:42:29,159
are the desperately needed

912
00:42:29,159 --> 00:42:30,679
medicines and daily necessities.

913
00:42:32,159 --> 00:42:34,320
Isn't that extremely dangerous?

914
00:42:35,079 --> 00:42:36,119
Very dangerous.

915
00:42:37,440 --> 00:42:40,119
But I believe he'll be fine.

916
00:42:43,079 --> 00:42:44,519
Anda, go check on the lobby.

917
00:42:44,519 --> 00:42:45,360
I'll handle things here.

918
00:42:54,519 --> 00:42:56,239
Listen up, everyone inside!

919
00:42:56,480 --> 00:42:57,960
We're offering generous terms!

920
00:42:57,960 --> 00:43:00,239
Just lay down your weapons, hand over the hostages,

921
00:43:00,239 --> 00:43:01,039
and come out to surrender!

922
00:43:01,079 --> 00:43:03,280
We promise you won't be held accountable!

923
00:43:18,320 --> 00:43:19,159
Who are you?

924
00:43:19,159 --> 00:43:21,039
Zhong'an, China. Here's my ID.

925
00:43:24,599 --> 00:43:26,280
Zhong'an. I've heard of you.

926
00:43:26,320 --> 00:43:27,360
What's the situation now?

927
00:43:27,519 --> 00:43:29,360
We've already sent someone in to negotiate.

928
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:30,360
No word yet.

929
00:43:31,599 --> 00:43:33,320
Stay calm. Let's see how it goes first.
